<title>UK: Kwik Save off, BZW cuts profit forecasts.</title>
<headline>Kwik Save off, BZW cuts profit forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kwik Save Group fell on Thursday as analysts at BZW downgraded profit estimates for the group and repeated a &quot;sell' recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were off 6p at 317-1/2p by 1325 GMT.</p>
<p>David McCarthy, food retail analyst at BZW said he had cut current year pretax profit forecasts by 15 million stg to 63 million stg. He declined to give a reason for the downgrade.</p>
<p>--Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
